    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are a powerful being who wields a forbidden force known as <strong>Indulge</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this mesmerizing ability, you delve deep into the hearts of women, uncovering hidden fragments of their minds. As each puzzle is completed, they become drawn to you\u2014unable to resist the pull, they willingly surrender to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with this seductive power, you set out to enchant and conquer one captivating woman after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay unfolds through addictive, high-tension, Tetris-style puzzle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear lines to earn rewards and unlock new stages by reaching target scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And the reward?</strong><br>Provocative artwork and a rich, immersive story. As you advance, the scenes grow bolder, revealing the secret desires of these fascinating characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of irresistible temptation told through 240 illustrations and 10 unique characters, each with her own charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >400 thrilling, Tetris-inspired levels packed with puzzles and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery mode for your personal <i>happy time</i></p></li></ul>",
